WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 21]

01:45.220 --> 01:45.900
Tell me.

01:46.259 --> 01:48.259
What did you want me to come over for?

01:51.410 --> 01:52.670
I never drink alcohol.

01:53.700 --> 01:54.259
Really?

01:55.100 --> 01:56.160
You never tried it?

01:57.860 --> 01:59.259
You are afraid to face it.

02:00.060 --> 02:01.590
And you dare not drink this.

02:02.020 --> 02:02.820
You're afraid that after drinking it,

02:02.820 --> 02:04.280
you'll become Lu Li again.

02:09.889 --> 02:10.729
That's right.

02:11.300 --> 02:11.700
Here.

02:15.820 --> 02:16.500
How is she?

02:16.900 --> 02:19.020
You didn't allow her to stay in Xiyin Mountain,

02:19.020 --> 02:20.810
so I let Master take her away.

02:21.650 --> 02:23.620
I don't know where she is now.

02:24.220 --> 02:26.140
But he will take good care of her.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.750
Won't you go and see her?

02:33.260 --> 02:34.990
Since she has decided to leave,

02:35.579 --> 02:37.910
I don't think I should bother her anymore.

02:38.780 --> 02:40.180
It was you and Immortal Master Wanwu

02:40.180 --> 02:41.660
who drove her away, okay?

02:41.740 --> 02:43.800
Don't you admit it? So hypocritical.

03:05.620 --> 03:06.680
It's been two days.

03:06.810 --> 03:08.410
You obviously can't take it.

03:08.540 --> 03:10.740
Can't you just stop planting this grass?

03:10.740 --> 03:12.780
Now you can no longer stay in Immortal Palace

03:12.780 --> 03:14.180
and will leave tomorrow.

03:14.540 --> 03:17.000
That cruel man wouldn't even come to see you.

03:17.220 --> 03:18.480
Why do you care so much?

04:00.060 --> 04:01.060
Immortal Master?

04:03.260 --> 04:04.260
Immortal Master?

04:10.180 --> 04:11.180
Immortal Master.

04:12.420 --> 04:13.420
Immortal Master!

04:18.740 --> 04:20.180
Help! Anyone here?

04:20.370 --> 04:21.700
Something happened to Immortal Master!

04:21.700 --> 04:22.580
Help!

04:32.300 --> 04:33.630
This hairpin is for you.

04:36.180 --> 04:37.240
What are you doing?

04:50.700 --> 04:51.430
How about it?

04:52.220 --> 04:54.460
This hairpin belongs to your palace, right?

04:54.460 --> 04:55.590
Do you recognize it?

04:59.940 --> 05:01.020
Yes.

05:01.580 --> 05:03.040
I thought it was too plain,

05:03.100 --> 05:04.630
so I gave it to someone else.

05:07.500 --> 05:08.700
Who did you give it to?

05:10.180 --> 05:11.180
I don't remember.

05:11.580 --> 05:12.380
Shang Yurong.

05:12.980 --> 05:13.700
Why are you still

05:13.700 --> 05:14.700
playing dumb?

05:15.260 --> 05:15.940
I saw

05:15.940 --> 05:17.800
you gave this hairpin to Liu Shao.

05:38.700 --> 05:39.260
No way.

05:41.020 --> 05:42.140
It can't be her.

05:42.500 --> 05:43.570
Why not?

05:43.980 --> 05:44.860
To be honest,

05:45.300 --> 05:47.140
she didn't do anything harmful.

05:47.460 --> 05:49.340
But she was humiliated, tortured and driven away.

05:49.340 --> 05:51.140
Anyone else would be resentful.

05:51.330 --> 05:52.700
Now that she was in despair,

05:52.700 --> 05:54.140
it was not surprising

05:54.340 --> 05:56.340
that she had the idea of killing someone.

05:56.340 --> 05:59.000
His cultivation is much stronger than Liu Shao.

05:59.380 --> 06:01.260
There is demon poison on this hairpin.

06:01.260 --> 06:03.380
And there are no signs of a fight in the room.

06:03.380 --> 06:04.460
It was possible

06:04.460 --> 06:06.390
if she did it while he was off guard.

06:22.900 --> 06:23.660
Energy pill?

06:25.460 --> 06:27.250
Immortal Master is indeed seriously injured,

06:27.250 --> 06:28.450
and his pulse is weak.

06:28.580 --> 06:29.500
But

06:30.060 --> 06:31.050
you'll

06:31.300 --> 06:32.260
also hurt yourself

06:32.260 --> 06:32.980
by doing so.

06:33.420 --> 06:34.500
Even if you don't want to wrong Liu Shao,

06:34.500 --> 06:36.020
you don't have to do such crazy thing.

06:36.020 --> 06:36.750
Cut the crap.

06:37.380 --> 06:38.909
Activate Tai Chu to help me.

07:20.980 --> 07:21.710
Don't worry.

07:22.500 --> 07:24.560
The Weirui Grass has almost grown up.

07:24.740 --> 07:25.670
At most two days,

07:25.940 --> 07:26.860
I

07:27.460 --> 07:29.100
will definitely send it

07:29.100 --> 07:30.100
to that cruel man.

07:31.900 --> 07:32.610
Master,

07:34.180 --> 07:35.580
I'm counting on you then.

07:37.220 --> 07:38.620
It's been three days now.

07:40.020 --> 07:41.080
I really have to go.

07:46.860 --> 07:47.500
Girl,

07:48.220 --> 07:50.020
you should hurry down the mountain.

07:50.020 --> 07:50.890
When I'm free,

07:51.380 --> 07:53.380
I'll go to the human world to see you.

07:53.900 --> 07:55.700
I've seen enough of

07:56.620 --> 07:58.420
these cruel people here as well.

07:58.780 --> 08:00.710
So we'll see each other again soon?

08:01.500 --> 08:02.620
Don't cry.

08:02.980 --> 08:06.180
If you keep crying, this Weirui Grass will be pickled by your tears.

08:06.180 --> 08:08.020
I... these are not tears.

08:08.820 --> 08:09.880
It's herbal juice.

08:15.690 --> 08:17.580
I'm leaving then.

08:48.580 --> 08:49.460
Luo Ge.

08:53.740 --> 08:54.800
What's the matter?

09:00.540 --> 09:01.620
Is this yours?

09:02.420 --> 09:06.090
This seems to be the hairpin Shang Yurong gave me.

09:07.420 --> 09:10.220
Immortal Master Wanwu of Palace Wuji was assassinated,

09:10.220 --> 09:13.020
and the murder weapon was this white jade hairpin.

09:27.530 --> 09:29.060
When Immortal Master wakes up,

09:29.060 --> 09:30.020
we will find out

09:30.260 --> 09:31.790
whether you did this or not.

09:32.340 --> 09:33.100
Luo Ge

09:33.500 --> 09:34.760
can't help you either.

09:35.540 --> 09:36.770
I don't need his help.

09:37.300 --> 09:38.180
I just need him

09:38.420 --> 09:39.220
to believe me.

09:40.100 --> 09:42.250
Are you trying to get him to break his rules to trust you?

09:42.250 --> 09:42.900
Liu Shao,

09:43.620 --> 09:45.380
you really think of him as your family?

09:45.380 --> 09:47.510
Immortal belongs to the Three Realms.

09:47.740 --> 09:48.660
But Immortal

09:48.970 --> 09:50.830
is also that affectionate Luo Ge.

09:51.180 --> 09:52.910
I know what kind of person he is.

09:53.780 --> 09:55.580
Even if I don't love him anymore.

09:56.180 --> 09:56.900
Even if

09:57.740 --> 09:59.670
I don't love him the way I love Lu Li.

10:00.420 --> 10:01.150
But at least,

10:01.900 --> 10:03.630
he and I still trust each other.

10:04.090 --> 10:04.620
Maybe.

10:08.260 --> 10:09.330
But I think

10:09.900 --> 10:10.940
Immortal Luo Ge

10:11.220 --> 10:13.060
will only believe what he sees

10:13.580 --> 10:14.620
and hears.

10:26.220 --> 10:26.820
Master.

10:29.260 --> 10:29.730
Master.

10:30.660 --> 10:31.460
You are awake.

10:34.130 --> 10:34.820
Ge.

10:36.420 --> 10:37.460
You actually

10:37.740 --> 10:40.670
used your thousand-year spiritual power to save me?

10:41.380 --> 10:44.380
Don't you know how important your responsibility is?

10:44.620 --> 10:46.980
How could you waste this thousand-year spiritual power

10:46.980 --> 10:48.580
on me?

10:49.100 --> 10:50.500
You are like my father.

10:51.620 --> 10:54.220
You taught me and protected me since I was a kid,

10:54.220 --> 10:55.660
so now I must save you

10:56.460 --> 10:57.260
and try my best

10:58.140 --> 10:59.470
to seek justice for you.

11:02.500 --> 11:03.500
Immortal Master,

11:03.580 --> 11:05.310
Who is the person that hurt you?

11:05.580 --> 11:06.980
We're looking into this.

11:11.660 --> 11:12.540
It was her.

11:13.780 --> 11:14.420
Liu Shao.

11:28.380 --> 11:29.060
Liu Shao.

11:29.580 --> 11:31.180
How dare you!

11:31.660 --> 11:33.180
If it wasn't for Luo Ge,

11:33.460 --> 11:35.460
I wouldn't be able to keep you alive.

11:35.660 --> 11:37.500
How dare you come here to meet me?

11:39.890 --> 11:41.460
Are you saying

11:41.460 --> 11:43.180
that Immortal cares about me?

11:44.220 --> 11:45.420
Then why do you

11:45.620 --> 11:46.820
still drive me away?

11:47.340 --> 11:48.260
Do you know

11:48.500 --> 11:49.860
that I like him so much?

11:50.300 --> 11:51.830
I will take good care of him.

11:53.380 --> 11:54.300
Demon!

11:54.700 --> 11:56.780
How dare you seduce Immortal?

11:57.420 --> 11:58.550
You can't stay here!

11:59.900 --> 12:01.700
Don't be angry, Immortal Master.

12:01.700 --> 12:03.010
The reason why I came to you today is

12:03.010 --> 12:04.220
to tell you

12:05.020 --> 12:06.380
that Immortal Luo Ge

12:06.620 --> 12:08.260
was not seduced by me at all.

12:08.340 --> 12:09.060
Therefore,

12:09.090 --> 12:10.660
you don't have to conflict with him

12:10.660 --> 12:12.540
because of me.

12:13.540 --> 12:14.620
What do you mean?

12:16.060 --> 12:17.300
You may not know

12:18.220 --> 12:21.900
that when Lu Sheng ordered Lu Li to approach me,

12:23.180 --> 12:25.310
he cast a Soul-Devouring Spell on Lu Li

12:25.620 --> 12:28.550
in order to prevent Lu Li from falling in love with me.

12:29.100 --> 12:30.460
Lu Li died because of me,

12:31.540 --> 12:34.740
which made Luo Ge successfully return from tribulation.

12:35.370 --> 12:36.500
Immortal Luo Ge

12:36.780 --> 12:38.110
had got his appearance,

12:38.780 --> 12:39.500
his heart,

12:40.340 --> 12:41.940
and even one drop of his tear.

12:42.700 --> 12:43.630
But he did not get

12:44.020 --> 12:46.080
the Soul-Devouring Spell from Lu Li.

12:47.770 --> 12:48.770
Immortal Master,

12:49.650 --> 12:50.940
think about it.

12:51.530 --> 12:53.300
Is there any trace

12:54.180 --> 12:55.580
of Soul-Devouring Spell

12:55.900 --> 12:57.620
on Luo Ge's body?

13:02.940 --> 13:03.400
This...

13:04.340 --> 13:04.800
This...

13:05.660 --> 13:06.860
How is that possible?

13:09.340 --> 13:10.620
She had the breath

13:10.980 --> 13:13.140
of Sun Spirit in her body.

13:13.940 --> 13:15.540
I can't be wrong.

13:17.420 --> 13:18.340
Ge,

13:18.980 --> 13:22.180
I would swear by my thousand years of cultivation

13:23.300 --> 13:24.530
that it must be her.

13:28.300 --> 13:29.180
It was really her.

13:29.180 --> 13:29.740
No way.

13:31.220 --> 13:31.780
No...

13:33.060 --> 13:34.190
That's impossible.

13:35.740 --> 13:36.740
It can't be her.

13:39.980 --> 13:40.620
Ge.

13:41.940 --> 13:43.180
Seeing is believing.

13:44.460 --> 13:46.180
I'm not too old

13:46.300 --> 13:47.700
to tell real from fake.

13:48.460 --> 13:50.140
Liu Shao was crazy about love.

13:50.780 --> 13:53.420
She's no longer the girl who could stick to her heart

13:53.420 --> 13:55.420
and cross the Bone Melting Pool.

13:58.260 --> 13:58.860
Luo Ge?

14:01.980 --> 14:02.570
No way.

14:04.900 --> 14:05.380
Luo Ge.

14:05.820 --> 14:06.540
Ge.

14:09.100 --> 14:09.820
Ge.

14:14.060 --> 14:16.060
The feeling of getting what you want

14:16.380 --> 14:17.710
seems to make you happy?

14:18.940 --> 14:19.900
Anyway,

14:20.210 --> 14:20.900
thank you.

14:21.820 --> 14:23.280
Thanks to you for giving me

14:23.420 --> 14:25.420
the debris of Liu Shao's Sun Spirit,

14:25.890 --> 14:27.220
so I could impersonate Liu Shao

14:27.220 --> 14:29.680
without being detected by Immortal Master.

14:30.180 --> 14:31.180
It's just...

14:31.460 --> 14:32.300
where did you

14:32.500 --> 14:33.500
get this debris?

14:37.260 --> 14:38.300
Last time,

14:39.420 --> 14:40.750
she went to Demon Palace

14:41.060 --> 14:41.980
with Luo Ge

14:42.860 --> 14:44.500
and got drunk.

15:09.220 --> 15:10.460
I was thinking

15:10.980 --> 15:13.020
this would come in handy.

15:13.820 --> 15:14.620
Look,

15:15.780 --> 15:17.380
it turns out that I was right.

15:17.940 --> 15:19.000
I don't understand

15:19.500 --> 15:20.830
why you hate her so much.

15:24.180 --> 15:26.820
My brother is the dignified Demon King in White.

15:26.820 --> 15:29.420
He's handsome and gentle.

15:29.820 --> 15:32.150
What is my brother not good enough for her?

15:34.820 --> 15:36.480
Since this woman is so unwise,

15:37.220 --> 15:39.220
there will be no harm in killing her.

15:39.900 --> 15:41.740
Then congratulations.

15:42.340 --> 15:43.340
Your goal

15:43.860 --> 15:45.520
should be achieved in no time.

16:17.860 --> 16:19.920
Immortal Master has really woken up?

16:20.140 --> 16:21.010
Then

16:21.420 --> 16:22.860
the truth will be revealed.

16:22.860 --> 16:25.060
Liu Shao,

16:25.860 --> 16:27.140
aren't you going to confess?

16:27.140 --> 16:28.800
Are you saying I'm the killer?

16:29.010 --> 16:30.940
I narrowly escaped death.

16:31.340 --> 16:32.980
How could I frame you?

16:34.860 --> 16:35.860
It was really you.

16:36.770 --> 16:38.430
You looked so innocent before

16:38.700 --> 16:40.900
that I really thought I've wronged you.

16:42.020 --> 16:42.650
No.

16:43.020 --> 16:44.620
I didn't do it.

16:50.060 --> 16:52.330
Immortal Master saw you with his own eyes.

16:52.330 --> 16:54.010
That could also be wrong.

16:54.780 --> 16:56.420
There are so many talented people in Immortal Palace,

16:56.420 --> 16:58.100
it's easy for any one of them

16:58.260 --> 16:59.500
to impersonate me.

17:00.500 --> 17:03.100
Immortal Master has seen the Sun Spirit in you.

17:03.260 --> 17:05.020
You are the only one in this world

17:05.020 --> 17:05.980
who has it.

17:09.260 --> 17:09.770
So?

17:12.260 --> 17:13.900
Are you trying to say it wasn't you?

17:13.900 --> 17:14.339
Right.

17:15.619 --> 17:16.349
It wasn't me.

17:18.619 --> 17:20.690
Even if I am old,

17:20.859 --> 17:22.500
I can still recognize the person

17:22.500 --> 17:24.220
who tried to kill me.

17:24.300 --> 17:25.930
You're just too old!

17:25.980 --> 17:26.569
Stop!

17:31.810 --> 17:33.420
Don't be rude to Immortal Master.

17:33.420 --> 17:33.930
What?

17:35.020 --> 17:36.550
I can't even explain myself

17:36.900 --> 17:38.330
after you wronged me?

17:39.260 --> 17:39.790
Liu Shao.

17:40.740 --> 17:42.820
If it wasn't for Immortal Luo Ge exhausting his spiritual power to save Immortal Master,

17:42.820 --> 17:45.420
Immortal Master may really not be able to wake up.

17:45.420 --> 17:47.020
You keep saying you were wronged.

17:47.020 --> 17:49.340
Do you think it's possible that Immortal Master suffered such serious injuries

17:49.340 --> 17:51.060
just to wrong you?

17:57.180 --> 17:58.710
I don't know what happened.

17:59.190 --> 18:00.300
But I know

18:01.620 --> 18:04.420
that I never did anything to harm Immortal Master.

18:05.860 --> 18:08.020
Now the witness and evidence are all there.

18:08.020 --> 18:08.950
Look around you,

18:09.060 --> 18:10.720
who else dares to believe you.

18:23.700 --> 18:24.100
Luo Ge,

18:28.020 --> 18:29.020
do you believe me?

18:43.580 --> 18:44.700
How dare you, a murderer,

18:44.700 --> 18:46.700
call Immortal by his name directly?

18:47.500 --> 18:48.580
You have no right

18:48.930 --> 18:50.590
to tell others what to do here.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.060
Ge,

18:53.500 --> 18:54.700
I'm begging you.

18:54.740 --> 18:56.400
You can't pamper her anymore.

18:56.620 --> 18:58.680
Just punish her according to the law.

19:07.500 --> 19:08.140
Liu Shao.

19:10.060 --> 19:10.920
Think about it.

19:11.660 --> 19:13.120
Where were you last night?

19:14.300 --> 19:15.900
Can someone testify for you?

19:17.980 --> 19:19.110
Would you believe me

19:21.140 --> 19:22.740
if I said

19:24.500 --> 19:26.970
that I was practicing Ice Spirit in the back mountain

19:26.970 --> 19:27.700
last night?

19:28.740 --> 19:30.000
Do you have witnesses?

19:30.980 --> 19:32.380
What if I have no witness?

19:34.530 --> 19:35.180
Immortal.

19:35.700 --> 19:37.220
According to the regulations of Immortal Palace,

19:37.220 --> 19:38.340
those who cause serious injuries

19:38.340 --> 19:39.570
to the elders

19:40.140 --> 19:41.580
shall be taken to the Land of Heaven's Punishment

19:41.580 --> 19:43.840
and be executed by heavenly punishment.

19:44.140 --> 19:45.140
Such punishments

19:45.700 --> 19:47.300
are handled by Palace Wuxie.

19:47.700 --> 19:48.500
Immortal,

19:48.580 --> 19:50.110
please leave Liu Shao to me.

20:00.540 --> 20:01.740
After the execution,

20:01.860 --> 20:03.900
you can take back her Sun Spirit

20:04.060 --> 20:06.460
and choose another upright and kind person

20:06.500 --> 20:07.580
as its host.

20:18.210 --> 20:19.210
Did you hear that?

20:20.860 --> 20:21.740
Yes.

20:24.780 --> 20:25.700
But I also said

20:26.780 --> 20:28.780
that I have never been to Palace Wuji

20:29.340 --> 20:30.860
before today,

20:32.580 --> 20:34.440
nor have I left the back mountain.

20:36.090 --> 20:36.700
Luo Ge.

20:38.160 --> 20:41.270
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

20:39.300 --> 20:40.760
I'll ask you one last time.

20:41.270 --> 20:43.360
♫Into circles♫

20:41.740 --> 20:42.740
Do you believe me?

20:44.490 --> 20:47.340
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

20:44.580 --> 20:46.910
You have to give me a reason to believe you.

20:47.640 --> 20:49.440
♫The night is sleepless♫

20:50.750 --> 20:53.770
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

20:53.900 --> 20:56.080
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

20:54.940 --> 20:57.060
Because Lu Li would always believe me.

20:56.520 --> 21:01.890
♫Your promise, my fate♫

21:00.100 --> 21:02.140
Even if he didn't believe his eyes

21:03.470 --> 21:06.680
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

21:03.940 --> 21:04.700
and ears,

21:06.330 --> 21:07.420
he would always believe me.

21:06.690 --> 21:08.740
♫But my heart is still the same♫

21:09.500 --> 21:10.060
Ge.

21:09.820 --> 21:12.900
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

21:10.700 --> 21:13.050
How can you allow her to lie to you here?

21:12.900 --> 21:14.460
♫Is like the things we went through♫

21:16.110 --> 21:18.800
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

21:19.190 --> 21:21.120
♫The moment we passed each other♫

21:21.800 --> 21:27.520
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

21:26.020 --> 21:27.140
Lu Li is gone.

21:27.900 --> 21:33.220
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

21:30.020 --> 21:31.300
Lu Li is gone.

21:33.180 --> 21:34.690
So you don't love me

21:34.180 --> 21:40.230
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

21:36.020 --> 21:36.940
nor do you trust me.

21:36.940 --> 21:37.700
Shut up!

21:38.020 --> 21:38.580
Qiuxian.

21:39.260 --> 21:41.060
Take her to the Land of Heaven's Punishment for execution.

21:40.630 --> 21:46.850
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

21:41.380 --> 21:41.940
Yes.

21:46.850 --> 21:53.060
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

21:53.060 --> 21:57.980
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

21:57.660 --> 21:59.360
Since you and I have known each other before,

21:59.360 --> 22:05.330
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

22:00.220 --> 22:01.750
I'll keep your body intact.

22:02.140 --> 22:04.340
You will be punished by Icy Nightmares,

22:05.300 --> 22:06.980
and will die in agony in your nightmares.

22:05.720 --> 22:11.730
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

22:09.140 --> 22:10.900
People always have to pay

22:12.020 --> 22:18.450
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

22:12.060 --> 22:12.990
for what they do.

22:19.080 --> 22:21.970
♫Get lost in your sky♫

22:21.620 --> 22:22.260
It turns out

22:22.190 --> 22:24.790
♫Whose wilderness♫

22:24.180 --> 22:25.580
dying in the nightmare

22:25.400 --> 22:30.170
♫Clouds billow up and fade away in the four seas♫

22:27.420 --> 22:29.500
is your gift for me.

22:31.800 --> 22:34.840
♫The mountains and rivers after the farewell♫

22:32.220 --> 22:34.350
I would really like to appreciate you,

22:34.840 --> 22:37.100
♫Silence♫

22:35.540 --> 22:38.660
the supreme Immortal Luo Ge of the Three Realms.

22:37.100 --> 22:39.580
♫Time sighs silently♫

22:39.580 --> 22:44.460
♫Whose passing years♫

22:55.780 --> 22:56.710
There's nothing

22:57.820 --> 22:59.620
but only sorrow in my dead heart.

23:00.980 --> 23:02.700
The truth is nothing to me.

23:04.380 --> 23:05.440
Since Lu Li's gone,

23:06.780 --> 23:07.910
nothing is worth it.

23:17.420 --> 23:19.020
There's no need to feel sorry for her.

23:19.020 --> 23:19.970
She deserved it.

23:38.500 --> 23:39.700
Icy Nightmare.

23:40.020 --> 23:41.340
I heard the pain of it

23:41.660 --> 23:43.720
is not less than the Thunder Penalty.

23:43.780 --> 23:45.700
It even lasts longer.

23:46.500 --> 23:48.660
I didn't expect Luo Ge

23:49.170 --> 23:50.340
to be so cruel.

23:51.540 --> 23:53.340
He's even crueler

23:53.700 --> 23:55.700
than the way he treated me last time.

23:56.580 --> 23:57.260
All right.

23:58.380 --> 23:59.710
Your wish has come true.

24:00.060 --> 24:02.120
Now it's time for me to make requests.

24:03.780 --> 24:04.380
Go ahead.

24:04.660 --> 24:05.590
What do you want?

24:05.860 --> 24:07.320
Help me get the Moon Sword.

24:08.220 --> 24:10.380
Are you going to split the Four Seasons Monument

24:10.380 --> 24:13.240
and release the demon heart of God of the Moonlight?

24:14.380 --> 24:15.580
Something like that.

24:16.020 --> 24:17.350
Do you think I'll agree?

24:18.500 --> 24:19.060
Why not?

24:20.340 --> 24:21.420
If you don't agree,

24:22.570 --> 24:25.260
I will definitely tell Luo Ge something.

24:30.100 --> 24:31.030
What did you say?

24:31.460 --> 24:32.940
Immortal Master was assassinated,

24:32.940 --> 24:35.400
and Liu Shao was identified as the murderer?

24:35.460 --> 24:36.900
How is that possible?

24:37.180 --> 24:38.980
How could Liu Shao kill someone?

24:39.740 --> 24:40.340
No.

24:40.740 --> 24:42.740
I have to ask my brother about these.

24:45.540 --> 24:46.530
Seriously?

24:46.980 --> 24:48.380
He actually put a ban on me

24:48.380 --> 24:49.840
and kept me from going out.

24:50.530 --> 24:51.740
What should I do?

25:02.420 --> 25:03.020
How about I

25:03.660 --> 25:04.740
ask Fu?

25:13.010 --> 25:14.580
My little fairy is calling me.

25:14.580 --> 25:16.040
Think about it carefully.

25:16.540 --> 25:17.300
I believe

25:17.940 --> 25:19.900
you will make a right decision.

25:25.860 --> 25:27.590
I'll ignore Moon Sword for now.

25:28.330 --> 25:29.930
The most important thing now

25:30.450 --> 25:32.510
is that Liu Shao will be dead for sure.

25:32.540 --> 25:33.100
Luo Ge.

25:33.340 --> 25:34.620
I have already tried my best.

25:34.620 --> 25:35.680
I actually checked

25:36.140 --> 25:37.200
the three palaces,

25:37.340 --> 25:38.660
including Palace Wuji where Immortal Master lives.

25:38.660 --> 25:40.390
And I have checked all the roads

25:40.580 --> 25:42.210
towards the back mountain.

25:42.500 --> 25:43.500
But no one has seen Liu Shao

25:43.500 --> 25:45.100
these days.

25:45.420 --> 25:47.860
Someone must have seen her on her way back and forth,

25:47.860 --> 25:50.990
if Liu Shao had come back from the back mountain that day.

25:51.250 --> 25:52.980
The fact that no one has seen her

25:53.660 --> 25:54.660
means it's likely

25:55.620 --> 25:56.900
that she wasn't lying,

25:57.460 --> 25:59.140
and she really didn't leave the back mountain.

25:59.140 --> 25:59.780
So,

26:00.140 --> 26:01.660
you also think there's something suspicious about this,

26:01.660 --> 26:02.260
and

26:02.380 --> 26:03.300
you don't think

26:03.340 --> 26:05.800
Liu Shao would kill Immortal Master, right?

26:08.660 --> 26:09.660
It was impossible

26:10.540 --> 26:11.940
for her to do such a thing.

26:13.380 --> 26:14.940
But there are many weird spells in the Three Realms

26:14.940 --> 26:17.180
that can confuse people's minds.

26:17.420 --> 26:18.540
Maybe she was used,

26:19.940 --> 26:21.540
and she lost herself at the time.

26:21.540 --> 26:22.060
But

26:22.900 --> 26:24.760
we can't find anything right now.

26:24.980 --> 26:28.040
And even if we found out something, it would be useless.

26:30.330 --> 26:31.330
Icy Nightmare...

26:32.850 --> 26:34.180
After 24 hours,

26:35.140 --> 26:38.070
she will die due to the shattering of her energy pill,

26:38.660 --> 26:42.460
but with much more pain than the way she would die in Thunder Penalty.

26:43.180 --> 26:43.860
Actually,

26:44.610 --> 26:45.340
you also want to

26:45.340 --> 26:46.470
prove her innocence

26:46.500 --> 26:48.430
within twenty-four hours, right?

26:49.260 --> 26:49.860
After all,

26:50.780 --> 26:52.510
if it was Heavenly Punishment,

26:53.210 --> 26:54.980
she would have been reduced to ashes

26:54.980 --> 26:56.140
twenty hours ago.

26:56.300 --> 26:57.260
It has been twenty hours.

26:57.260 --> 26:59.460
She might not even have a bone scum left.

27:03.620 --> 27:04.680
I won't let her die.

27:04.860 --> 27:06.580
This is him.

27:07.220 --> 27:08.860
No, it's me...

27:08.860 --> 27:10.300
Remember, I have a name.

27:10.300 --> 27:11.220
Lu Li?

27:11.290 --> 27:12.330
Take me home...

27:13.060 --> 27:13.610
Lu Li.

27:14.620 --> 27:15.020
Lu Li.

27:17.140 --> 27:18.470
Why don't you trust her?

27:18.780 --> 27:19.910
Why did you hurt her?

27:21.570 --> 27:23.500
Why don't you see our past memories

27:23.620 --> 27:24.900
with your own eyes?

27:26.820 --> 27:28.880
I will always trust you in the future.

27:28.930 --> 27:31.300
Even if I don't believe my eyes and ears,

27:32.930 --> 27:34.590
I will certainly believe you.

27:38.060 --> 27:39.260
What happened to you?

27:40.290 --> 27:41.020
Are you okay?

27:41.460 --> 27:43.020
Don't make me worry about you.

27:43.020 --> 27:43.860
I just

27:45.660 --> 27:46.900
saw Lu Li's memories.

27:47.460 --> 27:48.390
What did you say?

27:49.900 --> 27:51.100
I said I believed her.

27:54.570 --> 27:55.580
Do you think

27:55.580 --> 27:57.420
my brother is unreasonable?

27:57.730 --> 27:58.300
How could Liu Shao

27:58.300 --> 28:00.420
assassinate Immortal Master Wanwu?

28:01.380 --> 28:02.660
Also,

28:02.660 --> 28:04.060
why did he lock me up here?

28:04.860 --> 28:06.330
He really pissed me off.

28:08.460 --> 28:09.260
Little fairy.

28:10.100 --> 28:10.860
Don't worry.

28:11.900 --> 28:13.360
I am already working on it.

28:14.260 --> 28:15.700
I can definitely find a way

28:15.700 --> 28:16.700
to break this forbidden spell

28:16.700 --> 28:18.300
and let you go out to save her.

28:19.220 --> 28:20.860
It's useless to read this.

28:21.100 --> 28:21.890
You can't

28:21.890 --> 28:23.890
undo my brother's forbidden spell.

28:24.660 --> 28:25.660
Luo Ge is not here.

28:26.660 --> 28:28.780
Now is the best opportunity.

28:29.620 --> 28:31.680
I'll have to think of something else.

28:38.260 --> 28:39.920
How about I pretend to be sick?

28:40.500 --> 28:40.860
No.

28:42.100 --> 28:43.820
I'll just pretend to faint.

28:43.820 --> 28:44.660
In this case,

28:45.100 --> 28:47.300
someone will notify my brother, right?

28:49.940 --> 28:51.220
When I see him,

28:51.500 --> 28:53.500
I'll definitely ask him about that.

29:15.260 --> 29:16.500
Immortal Luo Ge

29:17.340 --> 29:19.270
is probably not so easy to deceive.

29:21.460 --> 29:24.500
The amount of water energy really did not meet my expectations.

29:24.500 --> 29:26.420
If I forcefully break through the barrier,

29:26.420 --> 29:28.680
I will definitely be seriously injured.

29:28.940 --> 29:29.420
Will she

29:31.210 --> 29:32.100
save me?

29:34.020 --> 29:35.220
I can only take a risk.

30:38.250 --> 30:38.820
Fu!

30:43.220 --> 30:44.020
Fu!

30:44.020 --> 30:45.420
Fu, what happened to you?

30:45.940 --> 30:46.900
I was too stupid

30:47.300 --> 30:49.300
to break your brother's forbidden spell.

30:49.300 --> 30:50.360
I am badly injured.

30:50.850 --> 30:52.140
Can you save me?

30:52.140 --> 30:53.260
Okay, wait for me.

30:53.420 --> 30:55.260
I'll get someone to save you.

30:55.260 --> 30:56.320
Don't call anyone.

30:56.740 --> 30:58.000
You'll be implicated.

30:59.100 --> 31:00.260
You can save me.

31:01.180 --> 31:01.540
I...

31:03.250 --> 31:04.980
You have Bone-Corroding Harp.

31:06.170 --> 31:07.430
Bone-Corroding Harp?

31:07.980 --> 31:10.300
Hadn't the Bone-Corroding Harp been broken long ago

31:10.300 --> 31:12.340
and been kept in the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors treasury?

31:12.340 --> 31:13.540
Bone-Corroding Harp

31:14.540 --> 31:15.580
belongs to you.

31:16.900 --> 31:18.360
It will follow your heart.

31:20.820 --> 31:21.780
Call it.

31:22.180 --> 31:22.660
How...

31:22.980 --> 31:24.700
How is that possible, Fu?

31:26.180 --> 31:26.740
Fu!

31:27.340 --> 31:27.860
Fu.

31:46.300 --> 31:47.300
You are saying

31:47.460 --> 31:49.500
you remember something from your time in the human world?

31:49.500 --> 31:49.890
Yes.

31:51.020 --> 31:53.150
I believe the assassin wasn't Liu Wei.

31:54.930 --> 31:55.940
But if she dies,

31:57.740 --> 31:58.800
it will be too late.

31:59.820 --> 32:01.020
What do you want to do?

32:03.300 --> 32:03.970
Master.

32:03.970 --> 32:05.340
You can't go in, Master.

32:05.620 --> 32:07.620
Immortal won't see anyone today.

32:07.620 --> 32:09.620
How can he not meet me?

32:10.820 --> 32:14.740
I brought you something good for Liu Shao.

32:16.260 --> 32:16.980
Let him in.

32:24.580 --> 32:25.660
Greetings, Immortal.

32:25.660 --> 32:28.190
I finally fulfilled Liu Shao's entrustment.

32:29.620 --> 32:30.340
I've guarded this Weirui Grass for her

32:30.340 --> 32:31.940
until it's grown up.

32:33.500 --> 32:34.430
What did you say?

32:34.620 --> 32:36.220
Liu Shao planted this grass?

32:36.660 --> 32:37.060
Yes.

32:37.860 --> 32:39.460
I said that the vitality of Weirui Grass

32:39.460 --> 32:40.300
can cure

32:40.300 --> 32:42.140
Immortal's problems during cultivation.

32:42.140 --> 32:43.050
Regardless of her limping leg,

32:43.050 --> 32:44.310
she desperately tried

32:44.420 --> 32:46.340
to grow the grass

32:46.410 --> 32:48.580
during the last three days of her stay here.

32:48.580 --> 32:50.170
She is really amazing.

32:50.740 --> 32:51.340
In order to obtain

32:51.340 --> 32:53.780
the power of Yin and Yang that can make Weirui Grass sprout,

32:53.780 --> 32:55.980
she worked hard to practice Ice Spirit.

32:56.260 --> 32:56.920
I don't know

32:57.130 --> 32:59.140
which bastard made up that Spirit.

32:59.140 --> 33:01.420
The Yin and Yang were intertwined, the water and fire were incompatible.

33:01.420 --> 33:03.350
That almost tortured her to death.

33:04.260 --> 33:05.120
I didn't expect

33:05.780 --> 33:08.100
that she really made it

33:08.100 --> 33:10.160
and planted this grass in three days.

33:13.020 --> 33:14.150
Would you believe me

33:14.500 --> 33:15.980
if I said

33:17.660 --> 33:19.420
that I was practicing Ice Spirit in the back mountain

33:19.420 --> 33:20.100
last night?

33:22.380 --> 33:23.380
So,

33:23.380 --> 33:26.110
what Liu Shao said in the hall yesterday was true?

33:26.580 --> 33:28.300
Has Liu Shao been in the back mountain for the past three days?

33:28.300 --> 33:29.460
Of course.

33:29.460 --> 33:30.780
She never left.

33:31.780 --> 33:33.020
If it wasn't because

33:33.340 --> 33:35.200
the time for her to leave has come,

33:35.570 --> 33:37.660
she would have guarded the grass until it's grown,

33:37.660 --> 33:39.920
and then brought it to Immortal herself.

33:44.300 --> 33:44.900
Immortal.

33:45.660 --> 33:46.260
Immortal?

33:47.220 --> 33:47.820
Immortal?

33:50.260 --> 33:51.460
What happened to him?

33:54.300 --> 33:55.700
Liu Shao is too stubborn.

33:56.020 --> 33:57.500
Why didn't she say anything?

33:57.500 --> 33:57.980
Well...

33:59.140 --> 33:59.940
What's wrong?

34:10.260 --> 34:10.900
Luo Ge.

34:11.580 --> 34:12.780
I just want to ask you,

34:13.580 --> 34:14.620
do you trust me?

34:24.139 --> 34:24.739
Sorry.

34:25.980 --> 34:26.659
I'm late.

34:29.340 --> 34:30.340
Immortal Luo Ge.

34:30.340 --> 34:31.400
What are you doing?

34:31.500 --> 34:32.380
Wan Sui proved

34:32.739 --> 34:34.540
that it was not her who assassinated Immortal Master.

34:34.540 --> 34:36.340
Wan Sui has such a good relationship with Liu Shao,

34:36.340 --> 34:38.600
how could his words be used as testimony?

34:39.580 --> 34:40.139
Senior,

34:40.980 --> 34:42.040
I can also prove it.

34:53.100 --> 34:55.380
LiuShao is now in the depths of a nightmare.

34:55.380 --> 34:56.980
Unless someone wakes her up,

34:57.420 --> 34:59.350
she will surely die in another hour

34:59.410 --> 35:01.470
due to the rupture of her energy pill.

35:02.580 --> 35:03.540
Immortal,

35:03.610 --> 35:05.340
Palace Wuxie has its own rules.

35:05.740 --> 35:08.020
Since Liu Shao has been handed over to Palace Wuxie for execution,

35:08.020 --> 35:09.350
you can't take her away.

35:24.780 --> 35:25.300
Luo Ge,

35:26.580 --> 35:28.700
even if you enter the depths of her nightmare now,

35:28.700 --> 35:30.580
I'm afraid there's nothing you can do.

35:30.580 --> 35:32.640
You might not be able to come back too.

36:17.940 --> 36:18.540
Liu Shao.

36:31.210 --> 36:32.890
Liu Shao, wake up.

36:34.540 --> 36:35.780
Do you remember me?

36:36.020 --> 36:36.260
Liu Shao.

36:36.260 --> 36:37.420
We either die together...

36:37.420 --> 36:38.020
I'm Luo Ge.

36:38.140 --> 36:39.300
or we go together.

36:41.730 --> 36:43.190
We either die together...

36:55.140 --> 36:57.340
Don't... don't leave me!

36:57.340 --> 36:58.780
Liu Shao, wake up!

36:59.900 --> 37:00.900
Do you know

37:01.220 --> 37:02.740
that you will become a nightmare,

37:02.740 --> 37:03.870
if you don't wake up?

37:05.180 --> 37:05.860
Let me go!

37:06.460 --> 37:07.380
Let go of me!

37:32.860 --> 37:33.700
Lu Li.

37:34.300 --> 37:35.230
Why are you here?

37:36.700 --> 37:37.610
Luo Ge.

37:38.250 --> 37:39.780
Let me ask you one last time,

37:40.130 --> 37:41.060
do you trust me?

37:42.450 --> 37:44.650
You have to give me a reason to trust you.

37:45.260 --> 37:46.020
No.

37:46.590 --> 37:53.320
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

37:47.740 --> 37:48.940
You don't believe me.

37:49.860 --> 37:51.140
You never believed me.

37:52.980 --> 37:53.910
You're not Lu Li.

37:55.320 --> 37:59.490
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

37:55.540 --> 37:57.380
Lu Li died, all of this is fake.

37:58.180 --> 37:59.240
This is not a dream,

37:59.500 --> 38:00.140
I'm real.

38:01.070 --> 38:07.310
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

38:02.380 --> 38:03.340
The real Luo Ge

38:05.700 --> 38:06.740
and the real Lu Li.

38:08.010 --> 38:13.200
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

38:14.410 --> 38:18.050
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

38:17.930 --> 38:18.780
Luo Ge?

38:18.560 --> 38:22.070
♫I can't forget you♫

38:22.070 --> 38:25.660
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

38:22.340 --> 38:23.020
Luo Ge.

38:24.260 --> 38:25.460
I don't want to leave.

38:25.660 --> 38:27.610
I want to stay by your side forever.

38:25.900 --> 38:28.570
♫I have no other choice♫

38:28.570 --> 38:32.310
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

38:28.780 --> 38:29.700
Then stay.

38:32.310 --> 38:34.710
♫For billions of years♫

38:32.380 --> 38:33.260
But

38:34.020 --> 38:34.970
I don't want you

38:35.510 --> 38:39.260
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

38:35.580 --> 38:36.900
to get hurt.

38:39.260 --> 38:41.700
♫A few hasty nights♫

38:42.540 --> 38:46.370
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

38:46.370 --> 38:49.600
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

38:49.800 --> 38:56.360
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch, and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

39:24.700 --> 39:25.540
Be careful!

39:45.820 --> 39:46.700
No!

39:58.260 --> 39:59.790
It was Lu Li who trapped her.

40:12.340 --> 40:12.870
Liu Shao.

40:15.980 --> 40:18.180
All that you suffered in your nightmare

40:18.340 --> 40:21.600
was because you didn't want to lose that person on the boat.

40:21.820 --> 40:22.700
Do you know

40:22.700 --> 40:23.760
who was on the boat?

40:26.140 --> 40:27.270
It was Lu Li, I guess?

40:29.540 --> 40:30.800
I want to get Lu Li back,

40:32.180 --> 40:33.860
even if it's all in vain.

40:34.980 --> 40:35.980
Lu Li believed me.

40:40.580 --> 40:41.740
And Luo Ge didn't.

40:43.900 --> 40:45.850
So I can only love Lu Li,

40:48.020 --> 40:48.860
not Luo Ge,

40:52.060 --> 40:52.980
even if I know

40:55.500 --> 40:56.900
they are the same person.

40:57.610 --> 40:58.100
No.

40:59.540 --> 41:00.540
I believe you too,

41:01.380 --> 41:02.540
just like Lu Li.

41:03.730 --> 41:04.220
But...

41:06.180 --> 41:07.220
I'm sorry that

41:08.020 --> 41:09.480
I didn't protect you well.

41:11.020 --> 41:12.130
What did you say?

41:14.420 --> 41:15.550
I don't understand.

41:16.020 --> 41:16.550
Liu Shao.

41:23.500 --> 41:24.830
Lu Li is your nightmare,

41:25.820 --> 41:27.100
and also mine.

41:28.260 --> 41:31.060
The person you have been unwilling to lose is Lu Li.

41:31.300 --> 41:32.420
And Lu Li...

41:32.420 --> 41:33.180
is me.

41:36.180 --> 41:37.240
He is also the heart

41:38.900 --> 41:40.620
I have been afraid to face.

41:41.620 --> 41:43.100
It turned out that no matter how I tried to escape,

41:43.100 --> 41:44.760
I couldn't escape this heart.

41:44.820 --> 41:45.580
From now on,

41:46.540 --> 41:47.500
Luo Ge is Lu Li.

41:49.020 --> 41:50.550
I will stand in front of you,

41:51.020 --> 41:51.550
trust you

41:52.380 --> 41:53.310
and protect you.

41:55.060 --> 41:56.060
Because

41:57.700 --> 41:58.580
I'm afraid

41:59.740 --> 42:01.600
I can't escape this love anymore.

42:06.300 --> 42:06.740
No...

42:09.340 --> 42:10.470
This must be a dream.

42:11.980 --> 42:14.340
Luo Ge would never say such things to me.

42:20.820 --> 42:22.460
Whether it's a dream or not,

42:23.820 --> 42:25.780
I will never leave you again.
